# monsoon.thr  --  Plumb (Claude Opus 5.5), 2026-09-28
# the redeeming weather: a heavy billowed cloud-base rolls over, rain slants in on the wind in uneven
# streaks, splashing where the long ones land; one bolt goes to ground. Every streak is drawn out and back up itself,
# so no connector shows. The lower field -- the desert -- is left untouched grain, waiting.
# one continuous line; rho<=0.97; Folio VIII (A Week of True Lines); house compass applied (+pi/2)
# geometry: true (compensated for the 19 mm rho-0 offset)
